row(17, 19, 'MATERIAL', f'AND IT SHALL BE WITH HIM AND HE SHALL READ IN IT ALL THE DAYS OF HIS LIFE, THAT HE MAY LEARN TO FEAR THE LORD HIS GOD, TO KEEP ALL THE WORDS OF THIS LAW AND THESE STATUTES TO DO THEM. {HP(17, 19, (("והיתה", "עמו", "וקרא", "בו"), "and it shall be with him and he shall read in it — one seat"), (("כל", "ימי", "חייו"), "all the days of his life — the nights too (161:2)"), (("למען", "ילמד", "ליראה", "את", "יהוה", "אלהיו"), "that he may learn to fear the LORD his God"))} {AP(17, 19, (("ותהי", "עמיה", "ויהי", "קרי", "ביה"), "and it shall be with him and he shall be reading in it"), (("בדיל", "דילף", "למדחל", "קדם", "יי"), "that he may learn to fear before the LORD"))} THE READING: 161:1-5. Fresh.')
